          "username": "Zainab34",
          "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/z/ea666f/{size}.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-07T05:11:23.736Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Keep the same game in one listing with variants for printings and options, so buyers do not have to hunt for the right version.</p>\n<p>Make expansions and limited editions separate products, and link them from the main game page.</p>",
